      "accept": true
    },
    "CR13_worker_secondary": {
      "ruling": "工人次责：擅用他人 checkout 不举手",
      "review": "半服半冤。主责 tooling+裸 resume+工树被删；工人 raw 写明 Workspace moved / Working there / worktree_path=peaceful-austin。应 stop+open_question，但「擅用」语气过重——更像被推入唯一可写树后继续交付。",
